@blog_server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5115

### 前台：获取已发布文章
GET {{blog_server_HostAddress}}/api/articles

### 前台：按分类筛选
GET {{blog_server_HostAddress}}/api/articles?category=tech

### 后台：登录
POST {{blog_server_HostAddress}}/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "blog-admin"
}

### 后台：获取全部文章（需替换 token）
GET {{blog_server_HostAddress}}/api/admin/articles
Authorization: Bearer dev-admin-token-change-me

### 后台：新建文章
POST {{blog_server_HostAddress}}/api/admin/articles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer dev-admin-token-change-me

{
  "category": "notes",
  "kicker": "2026 · 06",
  "title": "测试文章",
  "copy": "摘要",
  "content": "正文",
  "tags": ["测试"],
  "published": true
}
